  "faithfulness_not_measured": "gemma-4-31b-it could not complete the faithfulness protocol. Its claim extraction failed twice in different ways: on HaluEval Summarization item 33 it emitted 7,772 characters of deliberation and no JSON array (fixed by scaling the reasoning token floor), and on item 43 it extracted zero claims from an evaluative summary, which the evaluator correctly reports as unmeasured and the calibration protocol correctly refuses to score. Both behaviours are the judge reading \"include only verifiable statements\" strictly, not a library defect. A threshold fitted only over the items it happened to score would be biased, so no faithfulness row is published for this judge."
